<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001C_S000C" variety="S000C">
<name>Audio &amp; Visual</name>
<ttl id="1001C_S000C_742AC_T002N" variety="T002N">
<name>Audio System</name>
<para id="X36100000W000HD" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="641GR-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="X36100000W000HD_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___00005EX00000">
<content5 releasenbr="2">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check (see <xref label="Seep01" href="X36100000W100HD"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Basic Inspection</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Basic Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the battery voltage.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>11 to 14 V (IG OFF)</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect areas that can be checked visually, such as blown fuses, open or short circuits in the wire harness and poor connector connections.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No Abnormality</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check Power Supply to Radio Receiver Assembly</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Radio Receiver Assembly LCD Illumination Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the ACC ON.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that when the audio POWER switch is turned ON, the backlight of the radio receiver assembly LCD display comes on and the LCD displays.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Comes on</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the inspection result and proceed to the following destination.</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.22in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.91in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Comes on</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Does not come on</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to LCD does not illuminate Symptom Chart: Power does not turn on when power switch is pressed (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000AQ6013X"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For details of the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000000FPQ00ZX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded DTCs, reproduce the problem symptom and check whether the DTCs are output again.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.22in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.91in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom cannot be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>When a DTC is output, perform inspection and repair according to the instructions in the Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart. (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM0000002RS03BX"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Symptom Simulation (see <xref label="Seep05" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM000000AQ6013X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.22in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.91in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis System (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM000000FPQ00ZX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM000000AQ5014X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
